  lines:
  - lineOrder: 0
    speakerId: Visiting Chef
    textTemplate: Thank you for inviting me into your kitchen. I would like to share
      a few plant-based meal ideas inspired by Okinawa.
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    emotion: Welcoming
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - lineOrder: 1
    speakerId: Visiting Chef
    textTemplate: We can begin with sweet potato, tofu, and greens. These are starting
      points for your menu, not a claim that one bowl represents an entire place.
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    emotion: Welcoming
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - lineOrder: 2
    speakerId: Visiting Chef
    textTemplate: Let us make room for those ingredients and try the new bowls. Your
      regulars can explore them at their own pace.
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    emotion: Welcoming
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
